1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
क्या heartbeat score = पूरी body-awareness?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Research का जवाब इतना सीधा नहीं

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
इंटरोसेप्शन = अंदरूनी bodily signals का processing

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
ECG + timed tones

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Signal synchronous था या नहीं?

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
यह objective task-performance है

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Heartbeat counting task अलग है

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Time और heart-rate का अनुमान असर डाल सकता है

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
दोनों tasks समान नहीं

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Questionnaire = self-report

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Self-report ≠ objective accuracy

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Accuracy + confidence का match?

13
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Awareness का estimate

14
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,000
नए tasks promising, पर perfect नहीं

15
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,800
एक score = पूरी interoception नहीं
Conceptual visuals; literal medical recording नहीं
